  message: "Shipped in refactor PR (commit 3c9bcc7c9). Added packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/_concept_utils.py with has_concept() and get_concept() helpers. Migrated all five audited consumer sites: middleware_chain.py, orm.py, subprocess_cli.py, http.py, openapi.py. Per audit (concept_tag_audit_04172026_0335.md) these are the only Framework-subcategory linkers that dispatch on symbol.meta['concepts']. Helper explicitly rejects bare-string entries (per INV-tuzub), centralizing the invariant at the consumer boundary. All 246 affected-consumer tests pass; 13 new unit tests for the helpers themselves at 100% coverage."  # 21d8
